{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18685","headline":"种术 · 柳宗元","name":"种术","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"守闲事服饵，采术东山阿。\n东山幽且阻，疲苶烦经过。\n戒徒斸灵根，封植閟天和。\n违尔涧底石，彻我庭中莎。\n土膏滋玄液，松露坠繁柯。\n南东自成亩，缭绕纷相罗。\n晨步佳色媚，夜眠幽气多。\n离忧苟可怡，孰能知其他。\n爨竹茹芳叶，宁虑瘵与瘥。\n留连树蕙辞，婉娩采薇歌。\n悟拙甘自足，激清媿同波。\n单豹且理内，高门复如何。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"柳宗元","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18685.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18685","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}